{
  "id": "steam_radiators_and_convectors___heating_capacitie",
  "title": "Steam Radiators and Convectors - Heating Capacities",
  "description": "Calculate the heat capacity of steam-heated radiators and convectors based on condensate rate, latent heat of steam, and temperature correction coefficients.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Steam Heated Radiator\n\nThe heat capacity of a steam radiator is calculated as:\n\n**Hr = qs × hs × λr**\n\nWhere:\n- Hr = heat capacity of radiator (kW, Btu/h)\n- qs = condensate rate (kg/h, lb/h)\n- hs = latent heat steam (2675 kJ/kg, 970 Btu/lb)\n- λr = radiator temperature correction coefficient\n\nThe radiator correction coefficient is:\n\n**λr = ((215 - 70) / (ts - tr))^1.3**\n\nWhere:\n- ts = average steam temperature (°F)\n- tr = room temperature (°F)\n\n## Steam Heated Convector\n\nThe heat capacity of a steam convector is calculated as:\n\n**Hc = qs × hs × λc**\n\nWhere:\n- Hc = heat capacity of convector (kW, Btu/h)\n- qs = condensate rate (kg/h, lb/h)\n- hs = latent heat steam (2675 kJ/kg, 970 Btu/lb)\n- λc = convector temperature correction coefficient\n\nThe convector correction coefficient is:\n\n**λc = ((215 - 65) / (ts - ti))^1.5**\n\nWhere:\n- ts = steam temperature (°F)\n- ti = inlet temperature (°F)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Radiator Calculations"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "condensate_rate_radiator",
          "label": "Condensate Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "kg/h"
        },
        {
          "id": "latent_heat_radiator",
          "label": "Latent Heat of Steam",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2675,
          "unit": "kJ/kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam_temp_radiator",
          "label": "Steam Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 215,
          "unit": "°F"
        },
        {
          "id": "room_temp_radiator",
          "label": "Room Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 70,
          "unit": "°F"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "lambda_r",
          "label": "Radiator Correction Coefficient (λr)",
          "formula": "Math.pow((215 - 70) / (inputs.steam_temp_radiator - inputs.room_temp_radiator), 1.3)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_capacity_radiator",
          "label": "Heat Capacity of Radiator",
          "formula": "inputs.condensate_rate_radiator * inputs.latent_heat_radiator * Math.pow((215 - 70) / (inputs.steam_temp_radiator - inputs.room_temp_radiator), 1.3) / 3600",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Convector Calculations"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "condensate_rate_convector",
          "label": "Condensate Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "kg/h"
        },
        {
          "id": "latent_heat_convector",
          "label": "Latent Heat of Steam",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2675,
          "unit": "kJ/kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "steam_temp_convector",
          "label": "Steam Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 215,
          "unit": "°F"
        },
        {
          "id": "inlet_temp_convector",
          "label": "Inlet Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 65,
          "unit": "°F"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "lambda_c",
          "label": "Convector Correction Coefficient (λc)",
          "formula": "Math.pow((215 - 65) / (inputs.steam_temp_convector - inputs.inlet_temp_convector), 1.5)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "heat_capacity_convector",
          "label": "Heat Capacity of Convector",
          "formula": "inputs.condensate_rate_convector * inputs.latent_heat_convector * Math.pow((215 - 65) / (inputs.steam_temp_convector - inputs.inlet_temp_convector), 1.5) / 3600",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Component",
        "Formula",
        "Standard Values",
        "Notes"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Radiator Heat Capacity (Hr)",
          "Hr = qs × hs × λr",
          "hs = 2675 kJ/kg",
          "λr = 1 at 70°F room and 215°F steam"
        ],
        [
          "Radiator Correction (λr)",
          "λr = ((215 - 70) / (ts - tr))^1.3",
          "Default: 1.0",
          "ts = steam temp, tr = room temp"
        ],
        [
          "Convector Heat Capacity (Hc)",
          "Hc = qs × hs × λc",
          "hs = 2675 kJ/kg",
          "λc = 1 at 65°F inlet and 215°F steam"
        ],
        [
          "Convector Correction (λc)",
          "λc = ((215 - 65) / (ts - ti))^1.5",
          "Default: 1.0",
          "ts = steam temp, ti = inlet temp"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}